    <li><a href="https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-benchmark-engine">Current evaluation engine repository (migration target: bench-engine)</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/odango-chan/sandbox/blob/main/docs/architecture/sandbox.md">Sandbox platform architecture</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/odango-chan/sandbox/blob/main/docs/ownership.md">Component ownership rules</a></li>
  </ul><p class="muted">This page describes the evaluation model and reliability test directions. It does not replace Benchmark assets, Engine contracts, or individual Case definitions.</p></section>
</SiteLayout>
